  "fullDescription": "Focus Procreate Brushes – Grainy Texture Brush Set. Retro Illustration Brushes. Chalk, Speckle, Crayon, Marker Brushes. Digital Drawing Kit\n\nSet of 20 Procreate brushes that can give an extra dimension to your illustration and lettering work. Bring warmth, texture and personality to your digital illustrations with the Focus Procreate Brush Set — a versatile collection of 20 handcrafted grainy and textured brushes designed for expressive drawing, lettering and modern retro artwork.\n\nThis brush pack is perfect for illustrators, designers and creatives who want to achieve a natural analog feel inside Procreate, with rich textures inspired by chalk, crayon, ink, marker and paint.\n\nWhether you’re creating editorial illustrations, social media graphics, lettering pieces or character art, these brushes help you build depth, softness and visual interest effortlessly.\n\n– Ideal for textured illustration\n– Perfect for retro / modern graphic styles\n– Great for shading, fills, outlines and atmospheric effects\n\nThis set is made for the Procreate app, it doesn’t work on any other software.\n\nThis is a digital product — no physical item will be shipped.\nAfter purchase, you will be able to download and install the brushes instantly.",
